@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Kiem tra API dang chay -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Chi tiet bai tap ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 4. Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 5a. Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huiiii26/CNTTK23D"
}

### 6a. Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5b. Thieu du lieu -> 400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### 5c. Nop vao bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huiiii26/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5f. Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173"
}

### 5h. Nop vao bai tap da dong -> 400 + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huiiii26/CNTTK23D"
}

### 6b. Luot nop khong ton tai -> 404 + SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 5d. Thieu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/Huiiii26/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5e. JSON hong -> 400 do framework tra
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "dtc245200173",

### 5g. Sai phuong thuc -> 405 Method Not Allowed, Allow: GET
PUT {{api}}/api/assignments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}
